Q3a  structural. A solid's configuration map is a HOMEOMORPHISM (injective), so its material
     elements keep their neighbours. After a 1:1 passage the two halos' media share the
     overlap volume. RB1 gate 4 puts each cluster's cold mass with its galaxies (model peak
     14 / 10 kpc from the galaxies, gas hundreds of kpc away), so the interpenetrated cold
     mass the data require is at least M_c,sub = 1.4715e+14 Msun. A homeomorphism delivers 0.
     By invariance of domain the passage must drive det F through 0: the solid must fold.

